        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5561ba7b-91a6-4403-a351-227015f67c2f).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning, 47.\r\rA private client — an anonymous with close ties to the hospital administration — has come to us with an urgent complaint.\rSeveral members of staff at a prestigious medical facility in Hokkaido are allegedly trafficking controlled substances, participating in illegal organ trade, and — most damning — engaging in reckless behaviour that led to a patient’s death by tetrodotoxin (puffer fish) poisoning.\rThey want the culpable parties removed quietly and the hospital left intact.",
